      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "NorthTec Recon",
      "questDescription": "Jamal Rivers, SecOps Lead at NorthTec, has asked you to review a stream of executive-style emails staff are receiving and advise on next steps. Over five decision points you will evaluate reporting choices, inspect a forwarded message, interview employees about social media, assess attacker intent, and recommend organizational defenses. The quest teaches reconnaissance recognition, safe escalation, and layered response planning.",
      "questCompleteText": "You collaborated with Jamal to identify a reconnaissance campaign using public profile data, escalated the right concerns, and helped shape NorthTec’s multi-layered response and training plan. The team contained early probing activity and increased employee awareness to reduce future exposure.",
